Z||000000||Springtyme||08-24-2001||08:46 AM||||Most of you know about this white car that I'm totally in love with. Well, last night I went to the womans house and she let me test drive it. IT RUNS LIKE A DREAM!!! Anyway, it's an automatic, 4 cyl 88 Fiero with 71,000 miles. She's asking $2,000. The car is in perfect shape, and the only thing wrong with it mechanically is the gas guage (it's almost empty when it's at a 1/4) What do you guys thing? Good deal? Or no?<P>(Old thread is <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/009523.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Forum1/HTML/009523.html</A>  )<P>------------------<BR>            ~Springtyme~||||reg||5
