Z||000003||ChadMan||08-24-2001||09:35 AM||||Buy it, Springtyme!  You know you're in love with it already.  If you don't buy it, you'll always regret it.<P>I'm biased, of course.  I bought my 88 Coupe at 66K for $2500 and it has been the most reliable car I've ever had.<P>Don't worry about the gas gauge...all the 4-banger cars do that, including mine.  The only negative thing I have to say:  keep in mind that 88 brakes/suspension parts are expensive and getting harder to find at local auto parts stores.<P>||||reg||14
